espectively, and are comparable to those shown for the following dates.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 13, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 1789, 1474, 1902], \"page_id\": 54}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014Table is based on Treasury data and on data reported to the Treasury by banks, other depository institutions and brokers in the United States. Data generally correspond to statistics following in this section and in the \\\"Capital Movements\\\" section. Table excludes International Monetary Fund \\\"holdings of dollars\\\" and holdings of U.S. Treasury letters of credit and nonnegotiable noninterest-bearing special U.S. notes held by international and regional organizations.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [144, 2041, 302, 2062], \"page_id\": 54}], \"content\": \"September 2007\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 15, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [548, 94, 1087, 132], \"page_id\": 55}], \"content\": \"INTERNATIONAL FINANCIAL STATISTICS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1448, 94, 1497, 132], \"page_id\": 55}], \"content\": \"49\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [322, 189, 1315, 271], \"page_id\": 55}], \"content\": \"TABLE IFS-3.\\u2014Nonmarketable U.S. Treasury Bonds and Notes Issued to Official Institutions and Other Residents of Foreign Countries\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [534, 271, 1098, 302], \"page_id\": 55}], \"content\": \"[In millions of dollars. Source: Treasury International Capital Reporting System]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [146, 304, 1484, 1725], \"page_id\": 55}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>End of calendar year or month</th><th>Grand total (1)</th><th>Total (2)</th><th>Argentine 1 (3)</th><th>Mexico 2 (4)</th><th>Venezuel