{"type":"message","message":{"id":"msg_eea08224-4ccf-458b-b5b8-5920b50fcdee","role":"user","created":1775346003,"content":[{"type":"toolResponse","id":"call_43aae4d0d6d74928818d4ee8","toolResult":{"status":"success","value":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nonfarm payroll employment rose by 92,000 in July following a 126,000 increase in June. Job growth in the latest month was restrained by a large drop in Government employment. Private sector hiring resulted in 120,000 new jobs in July. In the first 7 months of 2007, nearly 1 million jobs were created, bringing total job growth since the August 2003 employment trough to 8.3 million. Hiring in health care, leisure and hospitality, and professional and business services was particularly strong in the first 7 months of 2007. Job growth in those industries was only partially offset\nPayroll Employment","annotations":{"priority":0.0}}],"structuredContent":{"stdout":"Nonfarm payroll employment rose by 92,000 in July following a 126,000 increase in June. Job growth in the latest month was restrained by a large drop in Government employment. Private sector hiring resulted in 120,000 new jobs in July. In the first 7 months of 2007, nearly 1 million jobs were created, bringing total job growth since the August 2003 employment trough to 8.3 million. Hiring in health care, leisure and hospitality, and professional and business services was particularly strong in the first 7 months of 2007. Job growth in those industries was only partially offset\nPayroll Employment","stderr":"","exit_code":0},"isError":false}}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
